   112	// flag: the Skeptic runs on its OWN key (like the judge), so a Gemini-only live deployment runs the
   113	// deterministic affirmative pass and is unchanged. The ENABLE_SKEPTIC AND-gate exists so that merely
   114	// configuring the judge's Groq key does not silently activate an outbound-action gate (see
