   132	// The STRUCTURED finding the Skeptic challenges -- the quarantine boundary made data. EVERY field
   133	// here is a validated/CLOSED value: a closed-vocab event type, the ISO-validated country + the
   134	// canonical (forced) chokepoint, numeric corroboration counts, sector taxonomy values. There is NO
