   136	// location.region. region is the ONE location sub-field the Sentinel firewall leaves as sanitized
   137	// free text (country is ISO-validated, chokepoint is forced to the canonical known value, but region
   138	// is only control-stripped, never injection-scanned), so it is news-derived text and is DROPPED here.
   139	// `geo` (the closed-vocab GeoStatus) carries the geo-coherence signal the critic needs -- a closed
