   337	// estimateLiveCallCostUsd: a conservative upper-bound dollar estimate for a single
   338	// live call, used as `estimatedNextUsd` for the budget pre-check (we cannot know the
   339	// real cost until AFTER the call). Prices a fixed token envelope at the call's model;
   340	// the envelope is deliberately generous so the guard errs toward blocking, not toward
   341	// overspending. Pure; reuses the pinned price table.
   342	export function estimateLiveCallCostUsd(
   343	  model: string,
