    15	## 1. Verdict in one paragraph
    16	
    17	The agentic engine is **real and it works** — a tool-using Investigator loop ran 5 genuine steps live
    18	this session on the flagship scenario for 1.4 cents in 13 seconds. But the product is **not** an
    19	end-to-end working agentic AI product today, for two independent reasons. **(A) A live-blocking
    20	defect:** the cross-family Skeptic's model was decommissioned by its provider, so every live run
    21	fails closed to `NO_ACTION` and emits nothing — no playbooks, no drafts, gatekeeper `BLOCKED`. The
    22	project's headline differentiator is down. **(B) A reachability gap:** even with the engine healthy,
    23	no surface a person can touch runs it. `/` serves a frozen replay, `/loop` replays a recording,
    24	`/customs` is deterministic, and the one live door (`/api/run-exception`) is bearer-token-gated with
    25	`live` defaulting false. Nothing is deployed. The fix for (A) is small and landed this session; the
    26	fix for (B) is the already-planned Playground, which your ask sharpens rather than changes.
