    22	// THE FAIL-CLOSED TRAP (load-bearing): Slack returns HTTP 200 even on a LOGICAL
    23	// failure -- { ok: false, error: "not_in_channel" | "invalid_auth" | ... }. Checking
    24	// only the HTTP status would record a FAILED post as EXECUTED/delivered:true (a lie in
    25	// the audit trail). So deliver() THROWS on a non-2xx status, on body.ok !== true, on an
