    27	// Every failure path throws; the ONLY return is a genuine delivered receipt. A throw is
    28	// the fail-closed signal dispatchAndFinalize records as FAILED.
    29	//
    30	// The thrown error's NAME (not message) becomes the audited errorClass (action-executor
